  "content": "<h3><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/A3ASNUs\" alt=\"\" width=\"NaN\" height=\"NaN\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2kypF7e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"292\"><br><br></strong></h3><p><strong>🎉 歡迎來到神話方塊寶可夢 🎉</strong></p><p><strong>這張地圖旨在提供標準的 Minecraft 冒險體驗，但地圖上設有選單，您可以在其中找到寶可夢中心、道具商店和道館。</strong></p><p><strong>這張地圖的設計是為了在方塊寶可夢的世界中，結合探索、戰鬥和進度，提供具有挑戰性的 Minecraft 體驗。</strong></p><p><strong>做你想做的，創造你想創造的，捕捉你想捕捉的，用你自己的方式征服它。 🗺️⚔️</strong></p><p><strong>使用 Radical Cobblemon Trainers 模組，準備好踏上充滿挑戰的旅程，面對道館和四天王。 😉</strong></p><h4><strong>📝 地圖內容：📝<br></strong><strong>- 8 個道館 🏆<br></strong><strong>- 四天王 👑</strong><br><strong>- 寶可夢聯盟 🏟️</strong><strong><br></strong></h4><h4><strong>📝 必要模組：📝<br></strong><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></strong><br><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rctmod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Radical Cobblemon Trainers</a></strong><br><strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-npc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EasyNPC</a></strong><br><strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobbledollars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PokeDollar</a></strong><br><strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pokeblocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokeblocks</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblefurnies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleFurnies</a><br></strong><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks-unofficial-fabric-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks (Unofficial Fabric port)</a><br>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-badgebox/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Cobblemon] BadgeBox</a><br>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-mega-showdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: Mega Showdown</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-monuments-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legendary Monuments [Cobblemon]</a></strong></h4><h4>⚠️<strong>歡迎提供改進地圖的建議。我是地圖製作的新手，因此可能會有一些錯誤。此地圖無法在公開伺服器上使用。如果您希望使用，請與我們聯繫。</strong>⚠️<br>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&nbsp;<br><strong>👤 創作者：👤<br></strong>- Akiraヾ&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f934267676354834442%252f1364093379180494939\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">聯繫 📞</a><br><strong><em><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">⚠️ </span>禁止在伺服器上使用此地圖，未來或許會提供授權。 <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">⚠️</span></em></strong><br>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&nbsp;<br><strong>📝 資料包致謝 📝<br>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fpath-to-legends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: Path to Legends</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/cobblemon-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon additions</a><br>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fhydro-reanimodel-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hydro Reanimodel Pack [Cobblemon]</a><br>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fkales-cobblemon-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kale's Collection [Cobblemon]</a><br>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fbetter-cobblemon-spawns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Cobblemon Spawns</a><br>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobblemon-pokeloot%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PokeLoot [Cobblemon]</a><br><br></strong></h4>",
